  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:horita_derekh_teshuvah/stanza_4">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:horita_derekh_teshuvah/stanza_4/1"/>When his offspring [Cain] went astray
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:horita_derekh_teshuvah/stanza_4/2"/>by shedding his brother’s blood,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:horita_derekh_teshuvah/stanza_4/3"/>You sentenced him to be a wanderer,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:horita_derekh_teshuvah/stanza_4/4"/>to go from place to place;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:horita_derekh_teshuvah/stanza_4/5"/>but when he returned to You
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:horita_derekh_teshuvah/stanza_4/6"/>and left his evil ways,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:horita_derekh_teshuvah/stanza_4/7"/>You prolonged his life to seven generations,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:horita_derekh_teshuvah/stanza_4/8"/>anyone who found him
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:horita_derekh_teshuvah/stanza_4/9"/>was forbidden to slay him.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:horita_derekh_teshuvah/stanza_4/10"/>Cause us to return to You, Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:horita_derekh_teshuvah/stanza_4/11"/>and we shall return.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
